{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5619ac67860a2828fd9118e57fdbd5fba727f0a3182dabfc974049ba2731ccaa", "ja": "（いよいよ765プロ劇場、39プロジェクトの\n初公演が近づいてきた）", "zh": "（765艺能剧场推行的39PROJECT，\n终于快要到首次公演的日子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "840241100db82d24542ae46c38775497d27af9dff250a6d548b1b12b1674ca62", "ja": "（ここまで長かったような短かったような……。\nどちらにしても準備もあと少し。もうひと頑張りだ）", "zh": "（这一路走来说长不长，说短也不短……\n无论如何，准备工作就剩一点了，再加把劲吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "c0c87bbed2052d05e0788ea093e42ad8a1b236cc2f8d9ab2ce3c1d09c804aa26", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nよかった……。まだ残っていたんですね。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，辛苦了。\n太好了……你还没离开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f278d5ccb85b8635a5a690834ec6f85f20961b3035bac39f6ef2c1b4151e1337", "ja": "ああ、公演が近いから色々あって。千早はレッスンが\n終わったばかりか？　遅くまでお疲れさま。", "zh": "对啊，就要公演了，这边也有不少事情要做。\n千早是刚上完课吗？练到这么晚真是辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "67d896b1f0f5921c6bf66b1670fb5f977b0ef7e42c0dacc96b70db51cafe95be", "ja": "いえ、これくらい当然です。後輩のみんなも\n頑張っていますから、いい刺激にもなって。", "zh": "别这么说，这是我应该做的。\n看到新人们这么努力，对我也是很好的刺激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3752f58a92e72802d9ffb62ca4caf64d0a733a81b9225c4faf037580033f33ff", "ja": "そうか。みんなの頑張りは、\nレッスンの先生からも聞いてるよ。", "zh": "这样啊，我也有听课程的老师说\n你们都很认真喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ac696987a954a2ed069befc65048aa9dd0ae73e137d99e168e22a15260efec70", "ja": "ところで、さっき「よかった」って言っていたけど、\n何か俺に用か？", "zh": "话说你刚才讲「太好了」，\n是有什么事要找我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "c451d8be4ba205fdcdb4b6c6e883dc3d959083045cde16796b1b2fdd7451bdaf", "ja": "あ、はい。実は……\n先日、後輩達からアドバイスを求められました。", "zh": "啊，是的。其实……\n前几天新人们来找我，希望我能给她们一些建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "1a42d5d1fcc05a3628e2bdf3b359df81300c9c1695557dcd0a74297900b254a4", "ja": "ステージで歌っている時、\n私は何を考えているのか、と……。", "zh": "她们问我在舞台上唱歌时，\n心里都在想些什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0dbc01b46f3c395d1bbbfaa7bef41ea0d4b97fc24120c2815cd6b877bb56a21e", "ja": "なるほど。\nそれで、何て答えたんだ？", "zh": "原来如此。\n然后呢？你怎么回答？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "8fedb6099c90be6a493c391653ea758172c705ba9207115a6e47db51e000038a", "ja": "それが……考えてみたのですが、色々な思考や感情が\n混ざっていて、とても一言では言い表せなくて……。", "zh": "这个……我试着想了一下，发现唱歌当下会有许多\n思绪跟情感同时存在，实在是难以一言蔽之……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "2e2bc657794351a82db1885ccb25ce285b012c6a08a53ca23c3b56294135aac0", "ja": "かと言って、長々と説明したところで、きちんと\n伝えられるのか……まるで自信がありません。", "zh": "虽说如此，要是我解释得过于冗长，我也没有自信……\n是不是真的能把想表达的意思传达给她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "52ac0c5083b3e6ed15514b179a84313c92809672b185ff8bb441f295de97120a", "ja": "{$P$}なら、\nこういう時、どうしますか？", "zh": "如果是{$P$}，\n这种时候你会怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "56d333d8b3f2fa338c0654c9f476e22226f88f75dc6dbbc54c6e2cee525bff1e", "ja": "そうだなあ。俺なら……", "zh": "这个嘛，我的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_1014", "source_sha256": "f7bd17a7628025cccbb8615baf24dbea87db7b67a99be02f03361fc2f2a17ce2", "ja": "そのまま伝える", "zh": "如实陈述", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "095e173af4dfa55139854d4cfff5de98e8d2709e397d13b413cb202bdab42d83", "ja": "俺が千早だったら、\n今の千早の言葉を、そのまま伝えるかな？", "zh": "如果我是千早，\n就会把千早刚刚说的话直接讲给她们听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2001_002chi", "source_sha256": "6337f04645e563fd5fe4ab13279e161093dde4eb13d2629f5d48d84297f3eba7", "ja": "そのまま……？\nでも、これは考えではなく、ただの迷いでは？", "zh": "直接这样讲吗……？\n不过，这些应该只是我的迷惘，不能称作想法吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "372428f188139d01c20f7f583091e9c1232795ba12ce986dadd24e285f312f9d", "ja": "千早に質問してきたってことは、みんなはきっと、\n千早なりの答えを知りたいんだと思う。", "zh": "我想她们既然跑来问千早，\n那就代表她们想知道千早自己的答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2003_p", "source_sha256": "6ae4f932208d3ff8cb3433be8b6821a4ab72907231cf909b98e7feb276a7353f", "ja": "だから、千早の想いも迷いも、\nそのまま伝えるのがいいと思うよ。", "zh": "所以，不管是千早的想法还是迷惘，\n全都如实跟她们说就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "477ccaba5134880584609dd14c874cfa957c1f4a9e80ddef9259c5c39a97d5ac", "ja": "そこから何を感じ取るかは、人それぞれだからな。\n自分で考えるべきことを教えるのも先輩の務めだし。", "zh": "听了这些会有什么感受也是因人而异。\n教教她们自主思考的重要性，也是你身为前辈的责任哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2005_002chi", "source_sha256": "0ee4a508739f6cd466b444170acbc89aaced6d0a2d05515a0eb22ba292a857bd", "ja": "そう……ですね。確かに自分の言葉、\n自分の感覚で捉えなければ、歌は歌えません。", "zh": "你说得……也对。要是没办法用自己的言语、\n自己的感觉去理解，确实是无法唱好歌的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2006_002chi", "source_sha256": "43647b9a78c31bc8d22d5b6bc90e76ffd942cb5c95534c9997d20ea97bbbcbd6", "ja": "歌は、自分の心を映す鏡……。\n私はそう思います。", "zh": "歌声，就是映照出自身内心的镜子……\n我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2007_p", "source_sha256": "4a2d2416031d43d9947a63582b883986fc169fd9c82c3f8f9b3835380643fdbc", "ja": "千早らしくて、いいアドバイスじゃないか。\nさすが先輩だ！", "zh": "这个建议很有千早的风格，不是很棒吗？\n前辈果然厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2008_002chi", "source_sha256": "af7074c02f017b2756f04f987d62ae88555f26c2879f2f1d0d836a953a8ce71a", "ja": "や、やめてください。\n私はアイドルとしても先輩としても、まだまだです。", "zh": "别、别这样啦。\n不管是当偶像还是前辈，我都还不成气候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2009_002chi", "source_sha256": "b4da8f5bae971953885522800a58006d93d9cbcbbe906e25e2e1d79e4cb1f474", "ja": "とにかく、早速みんなに伝えて……あ。", "zh": "总之，我得快点去跟她们说……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2010_002chi", "source_sha256": "393346d8c349f98cce00a3016e8a70ffdcf1ae64408ed3cf62ed8f3c388c08c8", "ja": "私、アドバイスのアドバイスを\n{$P$}に求めて……？", "zh": "我为了想出好的建议，\n跑来找{$P$}寻求建议……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2011_002chi", "source_sha256": "6d7b95af4e6e016f1b55e6d8837dbb19fecd81b0b6b37ef5a117af2edc7e04b1", "ja": "ということは、このアドバイスは\n私の言葉ではない、ということに……？", "zh": "也就是说，\n这个建议并不是我自己想出来的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2012_p", "source_sha256": "6e49223a7ab2081e39e1f13e96a8fd8371bd07d017d31929a6728c6e09c5bb54", "ja": "いやいや。そのアドバイスは千早が言ったことだし、\nそれを千早が伝えることに意味があるんだ。", "zh": "不不不，那个建议确实就是千早自己讲的，\n要由千早亲口说出来才会有意义。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2013_p", "source_sha256": "98e205553605eccf088b10d6fcb0bf02669e1fcf9be6bfb6c527697c660102b3", "ja": "一番重要なのは、\nアドバイスを誰が言うか、だと思うよ。", "zh": "我认为最重要的，\n是看这个建议由谁讲出口才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2014_002chi", "source_sha256": "d469834bd9102491ae0e3f27af8b0b4988c30fe931963407ae751730572a5efc", "ja": "誰が言うかが重要……。ふふっ、そうですね。\nその通りだと思います。本当に。", "zh": "重要的是看讲出口的人是谁……呵呵，也对，\n我觉得确实就是如此呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2015_002chi", "source_sha256": "c72cc412c13f88138789c65cb0352fbf6bd37fc7618ad5c580778aaf348b3493", "ja": "では、今度こそ。行ってきます。", "zh": "那么，我这次是真的要去跟她们说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2016_p", "source_sha256": "a6448c549355ab3a41ca5610f4c6b8a3ed39b100ecc4291aeb12bf93fce931bf", "ja": "（公演を控えた大事な時期に、後輩のこともしっかり\n考えられる。それだけで、もう千早は立派な先輩だ）", "zh": "（公演在即的重要时刻，依然将新人们放在心上。\n光是如此，千早就已经是个了不起的前辈了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_002chi_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_002chi_003_2017_p", "source_sha256": "eb883127d31b0fd357af829561f01cbb63ca64a7697038e0075af1a50d8685d9", "ja": "（千早が後輩達と作り上げる初めての公演。\nどう輝くのか、本番のステージが今から楽しみだ）", "zh": "（千早与新人们携手呈现的首次公演。\n我已经开始期待正式演出时会有什么样的灿烂光辉了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
